,"summary":"使用向量检索技术检索FAQ","summary_en":"Using vector retrieval technology to search FAQs.","description":"使用向量检索技术检索，对FAQ问答对中知识进行检索，召回与用户意图相关性高的FAQ内容，推荐在需要结合上下文相关性、并对用户意图理解场景中使用。","description_en":"Using vector retrieval technology to search for knowledge within FAQ pairs, it retrieves FAQ content that is highly relevant to the users intent. This method is recommended for scenarios where contextual relevance needs to be combined and a deep understanding of the users intent is required."}]}');
